"Software" means the BlueView Weather (WeatherDock) source code, binaries,
documentation, and all associated files distributed under this license.

"BlueView" means BlueView and its authorized representatives.

"Non-Commercial Use" means any use that is not primarily intended for, or
directed toward, commercial advantage or monetary compensation. This includes,
but is not limited to:

  • Personal, hobbyist, or home use
  • Academic research and education
  • Non-profit organization use
  • Open-source project contributions (non-revenue-generating)
  • Evaluation and testing for potential non-commercial deployment

"Commercial Use" means any use that is primarily intended for or directed
toward commercial advantage or monetary compensation, including but not
limited to:

  • Incorporating the Software into a product or service that is sold,
    licensed, or otherwise monetized
  • Using the Software to provide services to paying customers or clients
  • Deploying the Software within a for-profit organization as part of
    revenue-generating operations
  • Distributing the Software (modified or unmodified) as part of a
    commercial offering

